    "title": "City of Jasper Presents $1M to Walker Area Community Foundation for Heman Drummond Center - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By The Walker Leader ,\n8 hours ago The City of Jasper has presented a $1,000,000 contribution to the Walker Area Community Foundation (WACF) in support of the Heman Drummond Center of Innovation, a major regional project that will expand career technical education opportunities for students in both the Jasper City and Walker County School Systems. The contribution... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
